UNWIND [{_id:496, properties:{durable_state_machine:"TranscriptionJob.status FSM: PENDING -> PROCESSING -> {DONE | FAILED}. Persisted in Postgres via Prisma (api/prisma/schema.prisma model TranscriptionJob). Side FSM on Meeting.status: UPLOADED -> TRANSCRIBING -> {TRANSCRIBED | ERROR}.", created:datetime('2026-05-22T12:00:00Z'), cancel_race_resolution:"If user deletes Meeting (UC-003) while UC-200 PROCESSING: Meeting cascade-delete removes TranscriptionJob row; worker on next save sees Prisma P2025 (record not found) and exits cleanly with structured log entry. No orphan Transcript row.", retry_semantics:"BullMQ retry: max 3 attempts, exponential backoff (initial 5s, multiplier 2). On 429/5xx from Deepgram, BullMQ retries; on 401/400/402/413 the worker throws non-retriable DeepgramAsrError and the job goes to FAILED. — REFINEMENT (FR-001): the failure handler MUST NOT write job.status=FAILED while BullMQ attempts remain for a TRANSIENT error (Deepgram 429/5xx); it re-throws so BullMQ schedules the next attempt. The idempotency guard therefore must NOT treat a non-final state as terminal. job.status=FAILED (and Meeting.status=FAILED) is written ONLY on a non-retriable error (401/400/402/413) or on the final exhausted attempt. attempt_count mirrors BullMQ attemptsMade.", recovery_procedure:"After process crash: BullMQ lock expires; another worker (or same worker after restart) picks up the job from PROCESSING and re-runs. ffmpeg + Deepgram call is restarted from scratch (no checkpointing of the audio extraction or ASR call). Acceptable because end-to-end is typically <5 min.", event_lifecycle:"Post-commit: SSE meeting.status event published to Redis pub/sub channel meeting:<id> AFTER Prisma transaction commits. Order: DB commit -> publish. Subscribers may miss events between transitions if they disconnect; current state is re-fetched from DB on reconnect.", transaction_boundaries:"Per BullMQ job. Each transition opens a Prisma transaction. PENDING->PROCESSING set on job pickup; DONE/FAILED set after Deepgram response written + Transcript row created (or error captured). Idempotent across worker restarts because Job.status is the source of truth, not in-memory state.", locks:"BullMQ job lock acquired by worker on job pickup; key=meetingId; auto-renewed by BullMQ heartbeat; released on terminal status. Only one worker may process a given meeting at a time.", uc_id:"UC-200", idempotency_key_strategy:"Job key = meetingId. Re-enqueueing for the same meetingId returns the existing job rather than creating a duplicate (BullMQ default with explicit jobId).", id:"RC-UC-200", updated:datetime('2026-05-26T10:32:48.947Z'), status:"approved"}}, {_id:504, properties:{durable_state_machine:"ProtocolGenerationJob.status FSM: PENDING -> PROCESSING -> {DONE | FAILED}. Persisted via Prisma. Side FSM on Meeting.status: TRANSCRIBED -> GENERATING_PROTOCOL -> {PROTOCOL_READY | ERROR}.", created:datetime('2026-05-22T12:00:00Z'), cancel_race_resolution:"Meeting delete during PROCESSING: cascade-delete removes ProtocolGenerationJob; worker exits cleanly on next Prisma write.", retry_semantics:"Max 3 attempts, exponential backoff (initial 5s, multiplier 2).\n\nCLASSIFICATION SETS (revised 2026-08-13, DEC-001).\nTRANSIENT (re-throw, let BullMQ retry): effective status 404, 408, 429, 5xx; plus network/transport failures (DNS, connection reset, socket timeout).\nPERMANENT (halt, write FAILED at once): effective status 400, 401, 402, 413, and any other unlisted 4xx; plus local errors (JSON parse failure, empty or unparseable completion, missing required section).\n\nEFFECTIVE STATUS. kie.ai is a gateway that MAY deliver a provider error INSIDE an HTTP 200 response, using the envelope {code:<int>, msg:<string>} (live probe 2026-08-13: an invalid Bearer key returns HTTP 200 with body {code:401,msg:'Unauthorized...'}). Classification MUST therefore run on the EFFECTIVE status, not on the HTTP status alone: effective = body.code when the HTTP status is 200 AND the parsed body is an object carrying a numeric `code` other than 200; otherwise effective = the HTTP status. An in-envelope 429/5xx is TRANSIENT; an in-envelope 400/401/402/413 is PERMANENT. Before DEC-001 an in-envelope error never reached the classifier at all: it fell through to the empty-completion branch and was reported as a permanent parse error, which both mis-classified transient provider errors and hid the real cause from the operator.\n\n404 IS TRANSIENT - this reverses the earlier MODEL_NOT_FOUND reading. The model id is sent in the request BODY, never in the URL (worker/src/llm/kieai.ts), so a 404 cannot denote an unknown model; a bad model id reaches the handler and comes back as an envelope error. Live probes 2026-08-13 show kie.ai answers an unrouted path with a Spring Boot whitelabel body {timestamp,status,error,message,path} - i.e. HTTP 404 means 'the gateway did not route this path', which is transient by nature (incident 2026-05-26: the identical request returned HTTP 200 twelve minutes later). A genuinely permanent 404 (a misconfigured base URL, as in commit 1f025b7) still ends in FAILED once the 3 attempts are exhausted; the cost of this reversal is bounded to 2 extra attempts plus ~15s of backoff, against the benefit of surviving every gateway routing blip.\n\nREFINEMENT (FR-001) - unchanged by DEC-001: the failure handler MUST NOT write job.status=FAILED while BullMQ attempts remain for a TRANSIENT error; it re-throws so BullMQ schedules the next attempt. The idempotency guard therefore must NOT treat a non-final state as terminal. job.status=FAILED (and Meeting.status=FAILED) is written ONLY on a PERMANENT error or on the final exhausted attempt. attempt_count mirrors BullMQ attemptsMade.\n\nAPPLICABILITY. This policy is observable only where the enqueued BullMQ job carries attempts>1. The automatic path qualifies (worker/src/jobs/transcription.ts enqueues the protocol job via createQueues(), attempts=3 + exponential backoff). The UC-004 manual-retry path does NOT: api/src/queue.ts builds its Queue without defaultJobOptions, so those jobs are enqueued with the BullMQ default attempts=1 and a transient error still fails them on the first attempt. Known gap, deliberately out of scope for DEC-001; tracked as follow-up F-004 (.tl/tasks/F-004/task.md).", recovery_procedure:"Process crash: BullMQ lock expires; another worker picks up. kie.ai call restarts from scratch (no LLM call streaming checkpoint). Cost implication: re-generation consumes tokens; acceptable for MVP scale.", event_lifecycle:"Post-commit: SSE meeting.status (GENERATING_PROTOCOL -> PROTOCOL_READY) published to Redis pub/sub meeting:<id>.", transaction_boundaries:"Per BullMQ job. PENDING->PROCESSING on pickup; DONE after Protocol row created with markdown_content from kie.ai response; FAILED on non-retriable error.", locks:"BullMQ job lock; key=meetingId; auto-renewed. Only one worker generates the protocol for a given meeting at a time.", uc_id:"UC-300", idempotency_key_strategy:"Job key = meetingId. The kie.ai call itself is not idempotent (LLM output varies); however the system-level effect (Protocol row created exactly once) is idempotent via Prisma uniqueness constraint on meetingId.", id:"RC-UC-300", updated:datetime('2026-08-13T11:11:20.836Z'), status:"approved"}}, {_id:511, properties:{durable_state_machine:"Multipart upload coordination FSM: INIT -> UPLOADING_PARTS -> {COMPLETING -> UPLOADED | ABORTED}. State held jointly by browser (in-memory parts ETag accumulator) + S3 (multipart upload object) + Meeting.status in Postgres (CREATED -> UPLOADING -> UPLOADED).", created:datetime('2026-05-22T12:00:00Z'), cancel_race_resolution:"If browser navigates away mid-upload, parts already PUT to S3 sit until S3 abandons-multipart-upload lifecycle policy (typically 7 days) removes them. Browser-side cancel calls /abort to release immediately.", retry_semantics:"Per-part PUT to S3: browser retries 3x with exponential backoff on 5xx. If a presigned URL expires (1h TTL), browser re-runs /init. No server-side retry — upload is client-coordinated.", recovery_procedure:"Browser refresh mid-upload: current implementation requires re-uploading from scratch (no resume from sessionStorage / IndexedDB). Documented gap for future hardening. Per-part retry within a session is supported.", event_lifecycle:"Post-commit: SSE meeting.status (CREATED -> UPLOADING -> UPLOADED) published to Redis pub/sub meeting:<id>. Browser receives the UPLOADED event and may navigate to the meeting detail page.", transaction_boundaries:"Per /init call: Prisma transaction creates Meeting + Recording rows with status=UPLOADING and s3_key + s3_upload_id. Per /complete call: another transaction sets Meeting.status=UPLOADED + Recording.uploaded_at, then enqueues the UC-200 BullMQ job. /abort releases the S3 multipart upload only; no Meeting row mutation (Meeting stays in UPLOADING and will be GC by a future cleanup job — not yet implemented).", locks:"No explicit application lock. The S3 multipart_upload_id is the implicit lock — only the holder of the s3_upload_id can complete the upload. Browser is the sole holder.", uc_id:"UC-100", idempotency_key_strategy:"Server-side: s3_key includes a fresh randomUUID per /init, so retried /init calls produce distinct uploads. /complete is idempotent against the same s3_upload_id (S3 CompleteMultipartUpload is idempotent when the resulting object is identical).", id:"RC-UC-100", updated:datetime('2026-05-22T12:00:00Z'), status:"approved"}}, {_id:527, properties:{uc_id:"UC-004", durable_state_machine:"Meeting.status FAILED -> {TRANSCRIBING | PROTOCOL_GENERATING} chosen by the most recent FAILED job's stage. The reset Job goes QUEUED -> IN_PROGRESS -> {DONE | FAILED}. Only a FAILED meeting is a valid entry state (RQ-036).", idempotency_key_strategy:"Idempotency key = meetingId + failed stage. If a job for that meeting+stage is already QUEUED or IN_PROGRESS, the retry is a no-op (no duplicate job created). Guards against double-click and concurrent retries.", created:datetime('2026-05-26T10:32:38.927Z'), cancel_race_resolution:"If the worker is already mid-processing the same meeting+stage (lock held), the retry no-ops via the idempotency guard rather than racing.", retry_semantics:"User-triggered, not BullMQ-driven. The AUTHOR action re-enqueues the failed stage as a fresh attempt (attempt_count reset to 0); there is no automatic retry of the action itself. The re-enqueued worker job is then subject to its own BullMQ retry policy (RC-UC-200 / RC-UC-300). KNOWN GAP (recorded 2026-08-13, DEC-001, not fixed here): the sentence above is aspirational for the protocol stage - api/src/queue.ts enqueues the re-run without defaultJobOptions, so the job carries the BullMQ default attempts=1 and RC-UC-300's retry policy never applies to a manually retried job. Follow-up F-004 (.tl/tasks/F-004/task.md).", recovery_procedure:"The action is itself idempotent and safe to re-issue. Crash recovery of the re-enqueued job is provided by the underlying worker UC (UC-200 / UC-300).", event_lifecycle:"Post-commit: SSE meeting.status event published to Redis channel meeting:<id> AFTER the re-enqueue transaction commits.", id:"RC-UC-004", transaction_boundaries:"Single Prisma transaction: reset the failed Job (status=QUEUED, attempt_count=0, error_msg=null) AND transition Meeting.status. Enqueue to BullMQ as an after-commit side effect (mirrors RQ-016 pattern in UC-200).", updated:datetime('2026-08-13T11:11:21.074Z'), status:"draft"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:RuntimeContract;
UNWIND [{_id:497, properties:{name:"PENDING", id:"RS-UC-200-PENDING"}}, {_id:498, properties:{name:"PROCESSING", id:"RS-UC-200-PROCESSING"}}, {_id:499, properties:{name:"DONE", id:"RS-UC-200-DONE"}}, {_id:500, properties:{name:"FAILED", id:"RS-UC-200-FAILED"}}, {_id:505, properties:{name:"PENDING", id:"RS-UC-300-PENDING"}}, {_id:506, properties:{name:"PROCESSING", id:"RS-UC-300-PROCESSING"}}, {_id:507, properties:{name:"DONE", id:"RS-UC-300-DONE"}}, {_id:508, properties:{name:"FAILED", id:"RS-UC-300-FAILED"}}, {_id:512, properties:{name:"INIT", id:"RS-UC-100-INIT"}}, {_id:513, properties:{name:"UPLOADING_PARTS", id:"RS-UC-100-UPLOADING_PARTS"}}, {_id:514, properties:{name:"COMPLETING", id:"RS-UC-100-COMPLETING"}}, {_id:515, properties:{name:"UPLOADED", id:"RS-UC-100-UPLOADED"}}, {_id:516, properties:{name:"ABORTED", id:"RS-UC-100-ABORTED"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:RuntimeState;
UNWIND [{_id:381, properties:{primary_actor:"ROL-01", source_bp:"BP-001", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"User selects a video file, optionally sets a language hint; system validates the file, uploads to object storage, persists Meeting + Recording, enqueues TranscriptionJob.", label:"Upload video and create meeting", id:"UC-001", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:382, properties:{primary_actor:"System", source_bp:"BP-002", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"Automated pipeline: dequeue job, fetch video from storage, extract audio, submit to ASR/diarization engine (EXT-02), receive speaker-attributed segments, assemble and persist Transcript.", label:"Transcribe audio with diarization", id:"UC-002", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:383, properties:{primary_actor:"System", source_bp:"BP-002-S07B", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"After diarization, system scans the transcript for self-introductions and addressed names. Anonymous speaker labels (Speaker 1, Speaker 2...) are substituted with resolved names where confidence is sufficient. Unresolved labels remain.", label:"Resolve speaker names in transcript", id:"UC-003", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:384, properties:{primary_actor:"System", source_bp:"BP-004", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"On transcript-ready event, system loads transcript, selects prompt template by language, submits to LLM (EXT-03), parses response into structured Markdown protocol with required sections, persists.", label:"Generate meeting protocol via LLM", id:"UC-004", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:385, properties:{primary_actor:"System", source_bp:"BP-002-S09 + BP-004-S10", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"Pipeline failure handling: mark job as failed with error_reason, update Meeting status to failed, surface in UI. Retry strategy (manual vs. auto) TBD.", label:"Handle transcription and protocol failures", id:"UC-005", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:386, properties:{primary_actor:"ROL-01", source_bp:"BP-003", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"User views and downloads the verbatim transcript from the recording detail page.", label:"View and download transcript", id:"UC-006", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:387, properties:{primary_actor:"ROL-01", source_bp:"BP-005", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"User opens the generated protocol in an in-app Markdown editor, reviews and edits content, saves changes. Save increments version and edit_count.", label:"Review and edit protocol in Markdown editor", id:"UC-007", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:388, properties:{primary_actor:"ROL-01", source_bp:"BP-006", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"User clicks Export to PDF; system renders Markdown protocol to PDF via export script and delivers as a download.", label:"Export protocol as PDF", id:"UC-008", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}, {_id:389, properties:{primary_actor:"ROL-01", source_bp:"cross-cutting", created:date('2026-05-17'), description:"Cross-cutting: UI surfaces Meeting.status reflecting the pipeline stage (uploading -> transcribing -> transcript_ready -> protocol_generating -> protocol_ready -> edited | failed).", label:"Display meeting processing status", id:"UC-009", updated:date('2026-05-17'), status:"candidate"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:UCStub;
UNWIND [{_id:502, properties:{payload_keys:["meeting_id", "status"], pre_or_post_commit:"post-commit", id:"RE-UC-200-STATUS", type:"meeting.status"}}, {_id:503, properties:{payload_keys:["meeting_id"], pre_or_post_commit:"post-commit", id:"RE-UC-200-COMPLETE", type:"transcription.complete"}}, {_id:510, properties:{payload_keys:["meeting_id", "status"], pre_or_post_commit:"post-commit", id:"RE-UC-300-STATUS", type:"meeting.status"}}, {_id:518, properties:{payload_keys:["meeting_id", "status"], pre_or_post_commit:"post-commit", id:"RE-UC-100-STATUS", type:"meeting.status"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:RuntimeEvent;
UNWIND [{id:"FR-001", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", pr:"https://github.com/ITSalt/transcriber/pull/5", dev_status:"released", dev_note:"BE fully PASS; UC-004-FE verified-pending (E2E deferred). Not yet released — PR #5 open, production-bound ERROR->FAILED migration runs on merge.", created_at:datetime('2026-05-26T10:34:49.403Z'), description:"Worker jobs cannot recover from transient ASR/LLM failures: the FAILED-write + idempotency guard no-op any re-attempt. Refines UC-200/UC-300 failure paths (transient vs terminal) so bounded auto retry-with-backoff works, and adds UC-004, a user-facing retry action for meetings stuck in FAILED.", released_at:datetime('2026-05-26T14:48:23.323Z'), title:"Worker Job Retry Resilience", delivered_in_release:"v0.3.0", dev_completed_at:datetime('2026-05-26T13:41:24.462Z'), bounded_only:false, updated_at:datetime('2026-05-26T10:34:49.403Z'), slug:"retry-resilience", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-001-retry-resilience.md"}}, {id:"FR-002", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", updated_at:datetime('2026-08-15T14:43:53.417Z'), created_at:datetime('2026-08-15T14:43:53.417Z'), description:"Raise MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES from 1 GiB to 1.5 GiB and add a 4-hour recording-duration gate, together with the pipeline fixes that make the advertised cap actually reachable (FLAC extraction, removal of a redundant in-memory audio copy, longer presigned-URL validity).", title:"Honest upload limit: 1.5 GiB byte cap + 4h duration gate", slug:"honest-upload-limit", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-002-honest-upload-limit.md"}}, {id:"FR-003", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", pr:"https://github.com/ITSalt/transcriber/pull/15", dev_status:"dev-complete", created_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), description:"PIN-only login with server sessions, workspaces as the isolation unit (personal + shared via membership), legacy meetings moved to workspace «Роман», operator CLI for users and blocks.", program:"product", title:"Login by PIN and workspaces", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-07T22:17:41.75Z'), work_package:"WP-BACKEND-01", slug:"login-workspaces", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-003-login-workspaces.md"}}, {id:"FR-004", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), created_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), work_package:"WP-BACKEND-06", description:"Projects with participants and glossary; the meeting context is entered on the upload screen as a draft and frozen into a snapshot on «Start»; the snapshot feeds ASR keyterms and LLM context sections.", program:"product", title:"Projects and meeting context with deferred start", slug:"projects-meeting-context", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-004-projects-meeting-context.md"}}, {id:"FR-005", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), created_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), work_package:"WP-BACKEND-06", description:"Append-only protocol versions (generated / user edit / legacy backfill), an audit record per LLM run, and feedback on a version: comment, corrected protocol, or a Word review parsed into JSON.", program:"product", title:"Protocol versions, generation audit and feedback", slug:"protocol-versions-feedback", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-005-protocol-versions-feedback.md"}}, {id:"FR-006", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), created_at:datetime('2026-10-07T17:33:38.875Z'), work_package:"WP-BACKEND-06", description:"After each protocol of a project meeting, the worker extracts tasks and decisions, resolves them against the project registry, applies them automatically or via a confirmation queue, and versions the project summary; storage is a separate production Neo4j fed by a Postgres outbox for deletions.", program:"product", title:"Project memory (tasks, decisions, summary) in Neo4j", slug:"project-memory", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/feature-requests/FR-006-project-memory.md"}}, {id:"FR-007", properties:{source_skill:"nacl-sa-feature", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:41.877Z'), created_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:41.877Z'), description:"После распознавания автор подтверждает спикеров: статус AWAITING_SPEAKERS, GET/PUT /api/meetings/:id/speakers, карта speaker_map с объединением меток (D-38).", title:"Speaker confirmation before protocol generation", slug:"speaker-confirmation", status:"spec-complete", markdown_path:".tl/external-contracts/speakers-confirmation.md"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:FeatureRequest{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"OBJ-001-ST01", properties:{name:"uploading", description:"File upload is in progress"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST02", properties:{name:"transcribing", description:"Transcription job is queued or running"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST03", properties:{name:"transcript_ready", description:"Transcript has been produced and persisted"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST04", properties:{name:"protocol_generating", description:"Protocol generation job is queued or running"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST05", properties:{name:"protocol_ready", description:"Protocol has been generated and persisted"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST06", properties:{name:"edited", description:"Protocol has been manually edited at least once; repeating state on each save"}}, {id:"OBJ-001-ST07", properties:{name:"failed", description:"Non-recoverable error in the transcription or generation pipeline"}}, {id:"OBJ-003-ST01", properties:{name:"queued", description:"Job created, waiting for a worker"}}, {id:"OBJ-003-ST02", properties:{name:"in_progress", description:"Worker is running ASR/diarization"}}, {id:"OBJ-003-ST03", properties:{name:"completed", description:"Transcript produced and persisted successfully"}}, {id:"OBJ-003-ST04", properties:{name:"failed", description:"Job terminated with non-recoverable error"}}, {id:"OBJ-005-ST01", properties:{name:"queued", description:"Job created, waiting for a worker"}}, {id:"OBJ-005-ST02", properties:{name:"in_progress", description:"Worker executing LLM request, awaiting response"}}, {id:"OBJ-005-ST03", properties:{name:"completed", description:"Protocol produced and persisted successfully"}}, {id:"OBJ-005-ST04", properties:{name:"failed", description:"Job terminated with non-recoverable error (LLM timeout, token limit, etc.)"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:EntityState{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{_id:405, properties:{last_reconcile:"2026-05-22 (nacl-tl-reconcile UC-200)", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:23.11Z'), created:datetime('2026-05-18T06:42:50.827Z'), module:"mod-common", values:["CREATED", "UPLOADING", "UPLOADED", "AWAITING_START", "TRANSCRIBING", "TRANSCRIBED", "AWAITING_SPEAKERS", "GENERATING_PROTOCOL", "PROTOCOL_READY", "EDITED", "FAILED"], name:"MeetingStatus", description:"Meeting pipeline status mirror per BRQ-008. CREATED (initial) -> UPLOADING -> UPLOADED -> TRANSCRIBING -> TRANSCRIBED -> GENERATING_PROTOCOL -> PROTOCOL_READY -> EDITED (post-edit). ERROR is terminal non-recoverable (BRQ-009).", id:"ENUM-MeetingStatus", updated:datetime('2026-05-18T06:42:50.827Z')}}, {_id:406, properties:{created:datetime('2026-05-18T06:42:59.421Z'), name:"MeetingLanguage", description:"Supported transcription/protocol language for a Meeting (BRQ-004). Null on the Meeting indicates pending auto-detect.", id:"ENUM-MeetingLanguage", updated:datetime('2026-05-18T06:42:59.421Z')}}, {_id:407, properties:{created:datetime('2026-05-18T06:46:35.849Z'), name:"VideoMimeType", description:"Allowed container MIME types for uploaded recordings. Sourced from BRQ-002.", id:"ENUM-VideoMimeType", updated:datetime('2026-05-18T06:46:35.849Z')}}, {_id:408, properties:{last_reconcile:"2026-05-22 (nacl-tl-reconcile UC-200)", updated_at:datetime('2026-05-22T15:19:33.62Z'), created:datetime('2026-05-18T06:48:36.403Z'), module:"mod-common", values:["PENDING", "PROCESSING", "DONE", "FAILED"], name:"JobStatus", description:"Async job lifecycle: PENDING -> PROCESSING -> {DONE, FAILED}. Terminal states (DONE, FAILED) are immutable per BRQ-009. Used by TranscriptionJob and ProtocolGenerationJob.", id:"ENUM-JobStatus", updated:datetime('2026-05-18T06:48:36.403Z')}}, {_id:553, properties:{source_fr:"FR-004", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-projects", values:["OURS", "CLIENT", "CONTRACTOR", "OTHER"], name:"ParticipantSide", description:"Сторона участника проекта (D-10).", id:"ENUM-ParticipantSide", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:554, properties:{source_fr:"FR-004", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-projects", values:["NEGOTIATION", "STATUS", "PLANNING", "INTERVIEW", "OTHER"], name:"MeetingType", description:"Тип встречи в контексте (D-10); влияет на подачу протокола.", id:"ENUM-MeetingType", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:555, properties:{source_fr:"FR-005", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-protocol", values:["PROTOCOL", "MEMORY_EXTRACT", "MEMORY_RESOLVE", "MEMORY_SUMMARY"], name:"ProtocolGenerationKind", description:"Что произвёл один прогон LLM (ProtocolGeneration.kind).", id:"ENUM-ProtocolGenerationKind", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:556, properties:{source_fr:"FR-005", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-protocol", values:["GENERATED", "USER_EDIT", "LEGACY"], name:"ProtocolVersionKind", description:"Происхождение версии протокола.", id:"ENUM-ProtocolVersionKind", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:557, properties:{source_fr:"FR-005", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-protocol", values:["COMMENT", "CORRECTED_PROTOCOL", "DOCX_REVIEW"], name:"ProtocolFeedbackKind", description:"Вид отзыва на протокол.", id:"ENUM-ProtocolFeedbackKind", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:558, properties:{source_fr:"FR-005", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-protocol", values:["SPEAKER_ATTRIBUTION", "MISSED_DECISION", "WRONG_TASK", "FABRICATED", "TERMS_NAMES", "STYLE", "OTHER"], name:"ProtocolFeedbackCategory", description:"Классификация отзыва (необязательна).", id:"ENUM-ProtocolFeedbackCategory", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:559, properties:{source_fr:"FR-006", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-memory", values:["OPEN", "IN_PROGRESS", "DONE", "CANCELLED", "POSTPONED"], name:"MemoryTaskStatus", description:"Статус задачи в памяти проекта. Переходы — TASK_STATUS_TRANSITIONS (shared/src/api/memory.ts): из OPEN/IN_PROGRESS/POSTPONED в любой другой; из DONE/CANCELLED только обратно в OPEN.", id:"ENUM-MemoryTaskStatus", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:560, properties:{source_fr:"FR-006", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-memory", values:["CREATED", "STATUS_UPDATE", "REASSIGNED", "DUE_CHANGED", "MENTIONED"], name:"TaskMentionKind", description:"Вид упоминания задачи во встрече ((:Task)-[:MENTIONED_IN {kind}]->(:Meeting)).", id:"ENUM-TaskMentionKind", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:561, properties:{source_fr:"FR-006", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-memory", values:["LLM", "USER"], name:"TaskEventSource", description:"Источник изменения задачи.", id:"ENUM-TaskEventSource", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}, {_id:562, properties:{source_fr:"FR-006", created:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z", module:"mod-memory", values:["AUTO", "PENDING", "CONFIRMED", "REJECTED"], name:"TaskEventReviewState", description:"Состояние проверки изменения (D-14).", id:"ENUM-TaskEventReviewState", updated:"2026-10-07T17:21:23.472Z"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Enumeration;
UNWIND [{id:"UC-004", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"ui_action", user_story:"As an AUTHOR, when a meeting failed during transcription or protocol generation, I want to retry processing from the failed stage so that a transient provider failure does not permanently brick the meeting.", system_uc:false, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Повторить обработку неудавшейся встречи", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["Given a Meeting in FAILED status, the detail page offers a \"Retry processing\" action that shows the error_reason.", "Triggering retry re-enqueues only the failed stage (transcription OR protocol) as a fresh attempt and moves Meeting.status out of FAILED.", "Re-triggering while a re-enqueued job is already QUEUED/IN_PROGRESS does not create a duplicate job.", "The action is unavailable (UI) and rejected (API, 409-class) when Meeting.status is not FAILED."], created:datetime('2026-05-26T10:31:57.164Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"high", actor:"AUTHOR", program_delta_fr:["FR-003"], is_release_gate_uc:false, source_bp:"BP-002/BP-004 (failure paths)", name:"Повторить обработку неудавшейся встречи", program_delta:["FR-003: доступ по членству, иначе 404."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Retry failed meeting processing", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-001", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to see all my meetings with their current pipeline status, so I know which are ready and which are still processing.", system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Посмотреть список встреч", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN at least one Meeting exists, WHEN I open the catalog, THEN I see a list of meetings sorted by updated_at descending.", "EACH row shows: title (or filename fallback), status badge (per ENUM-MeetingStatus), language, uploaded_at, duration if available.", "GIVEN a meeting in a transient state (UPLOADING / TRANSCRIBING / PROTOCOL_GENERATING), THEN its row shows a progress indicator that auto-refreshes."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, program_delta_fr:["FR-003"], name:"Посмотреть список встреч", program_delta:["FR-003: список — GET /api/meetings?workspace_id= (обязателен после WP-BACKEND-01), только встречи пространства; WorkspaceMeetingListItem добавляет workspace_id, project_id, project_name. В UI — «Задачи» (A-2).", "FR-004: статус AWAITING_START показывается как «Ждёт старта»."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"View meeting catalog", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-002", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:2, stale_origin:"FR-007", stale_reason:"FR-007 speaker confirmation (D-38): program_delta added", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to open a meeting and see its status, recording info, and links to transcript/protocol, so I have a single entry point per meeting.", system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), name_ru:"Посмотреть сведения о встрече", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN a Meeting, WHEN I open its detail page, THEN I see: title, language, status, recording metadata (filename, size, duration), and current job error_reason when FAILED.", "GIVEN status >= TRANSCRIPT_READY, THEN a link to view the transcript is visible (UC-201).", "GIVEN status >= PROTOCOL_READY, THEN a link to review/edit the protocol is visible (UC-301)."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, program_delta_fr:["FR-003", "FR-007"], name:"Посмотреть сведения о встрече", program_delta:["FR-003: чужая и несуществующая встреча → одинаковый 404, включая SSE GET /api/meetings/:id/events.", "FR-007: статус AWAITING_SPEAKERS виден в карточке и SSE meeting.status."], stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"View meeting detail", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-003", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to delete a meeting and all its derived artifacts, so I can clean up obsolete or sensitive recordings.", system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Удалить встречу", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN any Meeting, WHEN I confirm deletion, THEN the Meeting, its Recording (storage object removed), Transcript, Protocol, and all jobs are deleted.", "GIVEN deletion succeeds, THEN I am returned to the catalog (UC-001) with a confirmation toast.", "WHILE a job is IN_PROGRESS, deletion is disabled (or shows confirmation that an in-flight job will be marked FAILED)."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, program_delta_fr:["FR-003", "FR-006"], name:"Удалить встречу", program_delta:["FR-003: доступ по членству, иначе 404.", "FR-006: удаление встречи с project_id пишет GraphOutbox DELETE_MEETING в той же транзакции; дочерние таблицы программы удаляются каскадом."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Delete meeting", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-100", properties:{has_provider_dependency:true, spec_version:5, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to upload a meeting video of up to 2.5 GiB (max 4 h of recording) with an optional protocol-language choice, so the system starts transcription.", updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Загрузить запись встречи", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN a valid MP4/MKV/MOV file <= 500 MB (BRQ-001, BRQ-002), WHEN I upload, THEN the system accepts, creates Meeting + Recording + TranscriptionJob, and shows status UPLOADING -> TRANSCRIBING.", "GIVEN a file > 500 MB or wrong MIME, WHEN I attempt upload, THEN the system rejects before storage with a clear error.", "GIVEN a corrupt file (BRQ-003), WHEN validation fails, THEN the system rejects with a user-facing error.", "I can choose RU or EN as the language hint; leaving it blank means auto-detect (BRQ-005)."], runtime_contract:"required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:true, program_delta_fr:["FR-003", "FR-004"], source_bp:"BP-001", name:"Загрузить запись встречи", program_delta:["FR-003: init/complete/abort принимают workspace_id; предподписанные URL выдаются после проверки членства; новые ключи ws/<workspaceId>/…", "FR-004: complete с defer_start=true → встреча в AWAITING_START без постановки в очередь; UploadFinalizeResponse.status ∈ {TRANSCRIBING, AWAITING_START}."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Upload meeting video", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-200", properties:{has_provider_dependency:true, spec_version:4, stale_origin:"FR-007", stale_reason:"FR-007 speaker confirmation (D-38): program_delta added", entrypoint_type:"n/a", user_story:"As the SYSTEM, I dequeue a queued TranscriptionJob, run ASR + diarization on the recording, resolve speaker names, and persist a verbatim Transcript with status updates.", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), name_ru:"Распознать речь в записи", review_status:"stale", has_ui:false, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN a QUEUED TranscriptionJob, WHEN a worker picks it up, THEN job.status -> IN_PROGRESS and started_at is set.", "GIVEN ASR succeeds, THEN Transcript is persisted, speakers resolved per BRQ-021, Meeting.status -> TRANSCRIPT_READY, job.status -> COMPLETED, and a ProtocolGenerationJob is auto-created (BRQ-007).", "GIVEN ASR fails, THEN job.status -> FAILED with non-null error_reason (BRQ-010), and Meeting.status -> FAILED; terminal states are immutable (BRQ-009)."], runtime_contract:"required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"SYSTEM", is_release_gate_uc:true, program_delta_fr:["FR-004", "FR-007"], source_bp:"BP-002", name:"Распознать речь в записи", program_delta:["FR-004: если есть снимок контекста и ASR_KEYTERMS_ENABLED — keyterms по RQ-048 (AudioInput.keyterms); иначе запрос как сегодня. Отправленные keyterms и опции попадают в ProtocolGeneration.", "FR-007: для встреч с контекстом (snapshot_hash не NULL) вместо TRANSCRIBED + задания генерации воркер ставит AWAITING_SPEAKERS и ждёт PUT /speakers (UC-505); остальные — как раньше."], stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Process transcription pipeline", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-201", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:2, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to view the verbatim transcript with speaker labels and download it as a text file, so I have a permanent meeting record.", system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Посмотреть и скачать транскрипт", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN Meeting.status >= TRANSCRIPT_READY, WHEN I open the transcript view, THEN I see segments with speaker labels, timestamps, and counts (segments_count, speakers_count).", "I can download the transcript as a text file with a one-click action.", "Unresolved speakers (BRQ-021) are shown as 'Speaker N'; resolved speakers show the real name."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, program_delta_fr:["FR-003"], source_bp:"BP-003", name:"Посмотреть и скачать транскрипт", program_delta:["FR-003: доступ по членству, иначе 404 (включая скачивание)."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"View and download transcript", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-300", properties:{has_provider_dependency:true, spec_version:5, stale_origin:"FR-007", stale_reason:"FR-007 speaker confirmation (D-38): program_delta added", entrypoint_type:"n/a", user_story:"As the SYSTEM, when a transcript becomes ready I auto-trigger LLM-based protocol generation and persist the Markdown result with status updates.", updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), name_ru:"Сгенерировать протокол встречи", review_status:"stale", has_ui:false, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN a Transcript is COMPLETED, THEN a ProtocolGenerationJob is auto-created per BRQ-007 with status=QUEUED.", "GIVEN a worker runs the job, THEN it loads the transcript, selects the prompt template by language (BRQ-013), calls the LLM, parses the response, and validates required sections (BRQ-011).", "GIVEN LLM succeeds AND all required sections are present, THEN Protocol is persisted (markdown, version=1, edit_count=0), Meeting.status -> PROTOCOL_READY, job.status -> COMPLETED.", "GIVEN LLM fails OR response is invalid, THEN job.status -> FAILED with error_reason, Meeting.status -> FAILED."], runtime_contract:"required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"SYSTEM", is_release_gate_uc:true, program_delta_fr:["FR-004", "FR-005", "FR-006", "FR-007"], source_bp:"BP-004", name:"Сгенерировать протокол встречи", program_delta:["FR-004: промпт с секциями контекста (LlmInput.context, RQ-049); без контекста и памяти — байт в байт как сегодня.", "FR-005: в той же транзакции что Protocol — ProtocolGeneration(kind PROTOCOL) и ProtocolVersion n=1 GENERATED.", "FR-006: <project_memory> из ProjectMemoryProvider (по умолчанию NoProjectMemoryProvider → секция опущена); после задания — событие protocolJobCompleted для UC-600.", "FR-007: при подтверждённых спикерах (speakers_confirmed_at) реплики строятся из segments_blob + speaker_map; задание создаёт API при подтверждении."], stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:44.168Z'), updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Generate protocol pipeline", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-301", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"As an Author, I want to review the generated protocol and edit it in a Markdown editor, so I can correct LLM mistakes before sharing.", system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Просмотреть и отредактировать протокол", review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN Meeting.status in {PROTOCOL_READY, EDITED}, WHEN I open the protocol, THEN it loads in a Markdown editor with rendered preview.", "WHEN I save changes, THEN Protocol.markdown_content is updated, version increments by 1 (BRQ-014), edit_count increments by 1 (BRQ-015), last_edited_at is set, and Meeting.status -> EDITED.", "All edits operate on the canonical Markdown (BRQ-018); preview is a derivation."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, program_delta_fr:["FR-003", "FR-005"], source_bp:"BP-005", name:"Просмотреть и отредактировать протокол", program_delta:["FR-003: доступ по членству, иначе 404.", "FR-005: каждое сохранение создаёт ProtocolVersion USER_EDIT с author_user_id в той же транзакции; Protocol.markdown_content остаётся текущим текстом."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Review and edit protocol", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-302", properties:{has_provider_dependency:true, spec_version:1, stale_origin:"FR-003..FR-006", stale_reason:"program product FR-003..FR-006 (WP-BACKEND-06 contract v1): program_delta added; detail (activity/forms) to be refined by the consumer package", entrypoint_type:"embed-only", user_story:"As an Author, I want to export the protocol as a PDF, so I can distribute it as a polished document. [Note: triggered as an action from UC-002 detail and UC-301 editor; no dedicated screen.]", system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", name_ru:"Выгрузить протокол в PDF", review_status:"stale", has_ui:false, acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN Meeting.status in {PROTOCOL_READY, EDITED}, WHEN I click 'Export PDF', THEN the system renders the current Markdown to PDF and delivers it as a download.", "The rendered PDF is NOT persisted (BRQ-017); each export re-renders from canonical Markdown.", "The exported document includes all four required sections (BRQ-011): Participants, Discussion Topics, Decisions, Action Items."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:datetime('2026-05-18T07:01:52.727Z'), detail_status:"complete", priority:"MVP", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:true, program_delta_fr:["FR-003"], source_bp:"BP-006", name:"Выгрузить протокол в PDF", program_delta:["FR-003: доступ по членству, иначе 404."], stale_since:"2026-10-07T17:32:33.188Z", updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:23.437Z'), name_en:"Export protocol to PDF", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-400", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-BACKEND-01 / WP-FRONTEND-02", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как участник, я ввожу свой 6-значный PIN и попадаю в свои пространства, чтобы работать со своими встречами.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-003", name:"Войти по PIN", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:24.51Z'), acceptance_criteria:["GIVEN верный PIN и клиент не заблокирован WHEN POST /api/auth/login {pin} THEN 200 MeResponse и cookie transcrib_session (httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, 30 дней).", "PIN не из 6 цифр → 400 PIN_FORMAT; неверный → 401 INVALID_PIN «Неверный PIN».", "10-я неудача с клиента → 423 LOGIN_BLOCKED «Больше нельзя, пиши Максу для разблокировки», даже для верного PIN, до user:unblock.", "Без сессии любой /api/* кроме health и login → 401; веб ведёт на вход и возвращает на исходный URL."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-401", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-BACKEND-01 / WP-FRONTEND-02", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"button", user_story:"Как участник, я нажимаю «Выйти», чтобы завершить сессию на этом устройстве.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-003", name:"Выйти", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-07T20:18:50.308Z", acceptance_criteria:["POST /api/auth/logout → 204, сессия удалена, cookie очищена; повтор — тоже 204.", "После выхода любой защищённый запрос → 401."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-402", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-BACKEND-01 / WP-FRONTEND-02", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как участник нескольких пространств, я переключаю пространство и вижу только его встречи и проекты.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-003", name:"Работать в выбранном пространстве", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:34:24.51Z'), acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/auth/me отдаёт пространства (личное первым); выбор живёт в URL /w/:workspaceId/… или localStorage, иначе первое.", "GET /api/meetings?workspace_id= — только встречи этого пространства; не член → 404.", "Чужая и несуществующая встреча на любом маршруте (детали, транскрипт, протокол, PDF, SSE, удаление, повтор) → одинаковый 404."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-403", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-BACKEND-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"OPERATOR", entrypoint_type:"cli", user_story:"Как оператор, я завожу пользователей и членство, сбрасываю PIN и снимаю блокировки командами CLI, не трогая SQL.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-003", name:"Администрировать пользователей и блокировки (CLI)", has_ui:false, updated:"2026-10-07T20:18:50.308Z", acceptance_criteria:["user:create -- --name … --pin <6 цифр> [--workspace …]: без --workspace создаёт личное пространство; совпадение PIN → отказ.", "user:create --name Роман --workspace Роман привязывает к пространству «Роман» — он видит все старые встречи.", "user:grant, user:reset-pin, user:blocks, user:unblock -- --client <ip> | --all."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-500", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-PROJECTS-01 / WP-WEB-PROJECTS-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как участник, я создаю и правлю проекты пространства, чтобы группировать встречи и давать им общий контекст.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-004", name:"Вести проекты пространства", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", acceptance_criteria:["GET/POST /api/projects?workspace_id=, GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/projects/:id (shared/src/api/project.ts).", "Удаление проекта не удаляет встречи (project_id → NULL) и пишет GraphOutbox DELETE_PROJECT.", "Чужой проект → 404."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-501", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-PROJECTS-01 / WP-WEB-PROJECTS-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как участник, я веду список постоянных участников (имя, варианты, роль, организация, сторона) и глоссарий проекта, чтобы распознавание и протокол писали имена и термины верно.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-004", name:"Вести участников и глоссарий проекта", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", acceptance_criteria:["POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/projects/:id/participants[/:participantId] и /glossary[/:termId].", "«Добавить в проект» из контекста встречи — те же POST.", "Флаг asr_keyterm помечает термины для распознавания; подсказка: до 50 имён/терминов идут в распознавание, остальные — только в протокол."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-502", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:2, owner_wp:"WP-API-PROJECTS-01 / WP-WEB-PROJECTS-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как автор, пока файл грузится, я выбираю проект и указываю тип, цель, повестку, дополнительных участников и термины, предыдущий протокол и заметки (всё необязательно).", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T10:32:57.07Z'), source_fr:"FR-004", name:"Заполнить контекст встречи при загрузке", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", acceptance_criteria:["Веб завершает загрузку с defer_start=true → встреча в AWAITING_START, ничего не в очереди.", "PUT /api/meetings/:id/context (MeetingContextPutRequest) сохраняет черновик и project_id; после старта → 409 CONTEXT_FROZEN.", "Поля проекта показаны только для чтения с пометкой «из проекта»; предыдущий протокол: из проекта | загрузить (≤ 200000 символов) | нет."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-503", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:2, owner_wp:"WP-API-PROJECTS-01 / WP-WEB-PROJECTS-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"button", user_story:"Как автор, я нажимаю «Начать распознавание» после загрузки, чтобы запустить обработку с зафиксированным контекстом.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T10:32:57.07Z'), source_fr:"FR-004", name:"Начать распознавание", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", acceptance_criteria:["POST /api/meetings/:id/start из AWAITING_START → 200 StartMeetingResponse {status TRANSCRIBING, snapshot_hash}; повтор → 409 MEETING_NOT_AWAITING_START.", "Снимок = карточка проекта + добавления + текст предыдущего протокола; snapshot_hash = sha256(canonicalSnapshotJson).", "Распознавание ставится в очередь так же, как в finalizeUpload ({transcription_job_id, speaker_count}); правки проекта после старта снимок не меняют."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-504", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-PROJECTS-01 / WP-WEB-PROJECTS-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как автор, я вижу в карточке встречи, с каким контекстом сделан протокол.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T17:32:31.711Z", source_fr:"FR-004", name:"Посмотреть использованный контекст", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:45:47.742Z'), acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/meetings/:id/context → MeetingContextResponse: черновик до старта (frozen=false), снимок после (frozen=true, snapshot_hash).", "Без контекста → 404 NOT_FOUND; чужая встреча → 404."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-303", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, implemented_in:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 (PR #21, a7798d4): API only; UI in WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", spec_version:2, owner_wp:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 / WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", stale_origin:"FR-005", stale_reason:"FR-005 detailed by WP-API-FEEDBACK-01: steps added; UI forms still owed by WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как автор, я вижу историю протокола (сгенерировано / правка, автор, время) и отличия от оригинала.", system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/meetings/:id/protocol/versions → ProtocolVersionListResponse (по возрастанию n, current_n).", "GET /api/meetings/:id/protocol/versions/:n → текст; нет такой → 404 PROTOCOL_VERSION_NOT_FOUND.", "Перенесённые протоколы показаны как v1 LEGACY или GENERATED; строковой diff с v1."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"complete", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, source_fr:"FR-005", name:"Посмотреть версии протокола", stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", status:"identified"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:UseCase{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"UC-304", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, implemented_in:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 (PR #21, a7798d4): API only; UI in WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", spec_version:2, owner_wp:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 / WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", stale_origin:"FR-005", stale_reason:"FR-005 detailed by WP-API-FEEDBACK-01: steps added; UI forms still owed by WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как автор, я оставляю комментарий, исправленный протокол или Word с комментариями и правками, чтобы качество протоколов можно было улучшать.", system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["POST /api/meetings/:id/feedback multipart (kind, category?, text?, file?) → 201 FeedbackCreateResponse с extracted и protocol_version_n = текущая версия.", "Правила по видам и ошибки — RQ-052; .docx разбирается сразу, при сбое файл сохранён и extracted.error заполнен.", "Фикстура приёмки: 2 комментария, 1 вставка, 1 удаление → counts {2, 2}."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"complete", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, source_fr:"FR-005", name:"Оставить отзыв на протокол", stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-305", properties:{has_provider_dependency:false, implemented_in:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 (PR #21, a7798d4): API only; UI in WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", spec_version:2, owner_wp:"WP-API-FEEDBACK-01 / WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", stale_origin:"FR-005", stale_reason:"FR-005 detailed by WP-API-FEEDBACK-01: steps added; UI forms still owed by WP-WEB-FEEDBACK-01", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как участник, я вижу все отзывы на протокол (кто, когда, вид, файл) и скачиваю приложенные файлы.", system_uc:true, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), review_status:"stale", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/meetings/:id/feedback → FeedbackListResponse (новые первыми, имя автора, extracted_counts).", "GET /api/meetings/:id/feedback/:feedbackId/file → файл (attachment); чужое → 404."], runtime_contract:"not_required", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"complete", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", is_release_gate_uc:false, source_fr:"FR-005", name:"Посмотреть отзывы и скачать файл", stale_since:datetime('2026-10-08T10:38:35.703Z'), updated:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-600", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:true, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-WORKER-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"SYSTEM", entrypoint_type:"event", user_story:"Как система, после протокола встречи проекта я извлекаю поручения и решения, сопоставляю с реестром, применяю через гейт D-14 и обновляю сводку.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-07T20:42:52.779Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name:"Обновить память проекта после протокола", has_ui:false, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:45:47.742Z'), acceptance_criteria:["Модуль worker/src/memory register(ctx): своя очередь project-memory, подписка на protocolJobCompleted, замена ProjectMemoryProvider.", "Каждый вызов LLM — через ILlmCompletionProvider и запись ProtocolGeneration(kind MEMORY_*).", "Одна встреча — одна транзакция Neo4j; > 200 открытых задач — лексический предфильтр.", "Встречи без проекта память не трогают."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-601", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-MEMORY-01 / WP-WEB-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как участник, я вижу поручения проекта с фильтрами по статусу и исполнителю и историю поручения с цитатами и переходом к таймкоду транскрипта.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name_ru:"Посмотреть реестр поручений и историю поручения", name:"Посмотреть реестр поручений и историю поручения", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:45:47.742Z'), acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/projects/:id/tasks?status=&assignee= → TaskListResponse; GET …/tasks/:code → TaskDetailResponse (упоминания с start_ms, события).", "GET /api/meetings/:id/memory-refs — коды T-n/D-n встречи для ссылок со страницы протокола.", "Neo4j недоступен → 503 MEMORY_UNAVAILABLE; чужой проект → 404."], name_en:"Посмотреть реестр задач и историю задачи", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-602", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-MEMORY-01 / WP-WEB-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как участник, я подтверждаю или отклоняю спорные изменения поручений (закрытие, отмена, слияние, смена исполнителя, неуверенные) по цитате.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name:"Разобрать очередь подтверждения", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:45:47.742Z'), acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/projects/:id/review-queue → ReviewQueueResponse {items, count} (счётчик в шапке проекта).", "POST /api/task-events/:id/confirm применяет, /reject нет; история сохраняется; повтор → 409 TASK_EVENT_ALREADY_REVIEWED."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-603", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-MEMORY-01 / WP-WEB-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"form-based", user_story:"Как участник, я меняю статус, исполнителя или срок поручения, когда память ошиблась.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name_ru:"Исправить поручение вручную", name:"Исправить поручение вручную", has_ui:true, updated:datetime('2026-10-09T10:45:47.742Z'), acceptance_criteria:["PATCH /api/projects/:id/tasks/:code (TaskPatchRequest) → TaskDetailResponse; событие source USER с автором.", "Недопустимый переход → 400 TASK_STATUS_TRANSITION."], name_en:"Исправить задачу вручную", status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-604", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-API-MEMORY-01 / WP-WEB-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"navigation", user_story:"Как участник, я вижу решения проекта и текущую сводку с историей версий.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name:"Посмотреть решения и сводку проекта", has_ui:true, updated:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/projects/:id/decisions → DecisionListResponse.", "GET /api/projects/:id/memory → ProjectMemoryResponse {current, versions}."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-605", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-WORKER-MEMORY-01", created:"2026-10-07T17:31:33.433Z", detail_status:"detailed-be", priority:"product", actor:"SYSTEM", entrypoint_type:"event", user_story:"Как система, я применяю строки GraphOutbox к Neo4j, чтобы удалённые встречи и проекты исчезали из памяти.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:true, updated_at:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", source_fr:"FR-006", name:"Синхронизировать удаления в граф памяти", has_ui:false, updated:"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z", acceptance_criteria:["Удаление встречи с project_id → в той же транзакции строка DELETE_MEETING; удаление проекта → DELETE_PROJECT.", "Воркер применяет DETACH DELETE, ставит done_at; при недоступном Neo4j — attempts/last_error и повтор."], status:"identified"}}, {id:"UC-505", properties:{runtime_contract:"not_required", has_provider_dependency:false, spec_version:1, owner_wp:"WP-BACKEND-07 / WP-WORKER-06 / WP-FRONTEND-06", created:"2026-10-08T19:18:15.219Z", detail_status:"registered", priority:"product", actor:"AUTHOR", entrypoint_type:"screen", user_story:"Как автор, я после распознавания сопоставляю метки спикеров с участниками проекта или именами (объединяю дубли), чтобы протокол назвал людей без догадок модели.", is_release_gate_uc:false, system_uc:false, updated_at:datetime('2026-10-08T19:18:15.219Z'), source_fr:"FR-007", name:"Подтвердить спикеров", has_ui:true, acceptance_criteria:["GET /api/meetings/:id/speakers (AWAITING_SPEAKERS и позже): метки SPEAKER_n с длительностью, числом сегментов, 3 образцами реплик (≤200 знаков), текущим именем, участники проекта.", "PUT /api/meetings/:id/speakers {action: confirm|skip, mapping[]} только из AWAITING_SPEAKERS: пишет transcripts.speaker_map, speaker_mapping, speakers_confirmed_at, переводит встречу в GENERATING_PROTOCOL и создаёт одно ProtocolGenerationJob; повтор или другой статус — 409 MEETING_NOT_AWAITING_SPEAKERS.", "Несколько меток могут указывать на одного человека (объединение); participant_id чужого проекта — 404; метки нет в записи — 400 UNKNOWN_SPEAKER_LABEL.", "Встречи без контекста (snapshot_hash NULL) и уже в TRANSCRIBED идут по старому потоку без подтверждения."], status:"identified"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:UseCase{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{_id:501, properties:{owner:"worker", scope:"per-meeting", id:"RL-UC-200-BULLMQ", ttl_sec:30, key:"bullmq-job:transcription:<meetingId>"}}, {_id:509, properties:{owner:"worker", scope:"per-meeting", id:"RL-UC-300-BULLMQ", ttl_sec:30, key:"bullmq-job:protocol-gen:<meetingId>"}}, {_id:517, properties:{owner:"browser-session", scope:"per-upload", id:"RL-UC-100-S3-UPLOADID", ttl_sec:3600, key:"s3-multipart-upload-id:<s3_upload_id>"}}] AS row
